                "text": "Hardcoded poster secret: Track disclosure. Categories: Hard coded credential and broken object authorization. Weaknesses: CWE-639, CWE-798.\n\nRemediation:\n\nRemove the static poster secret, authorize reads against the user or a scoped per-track token, and rotate the current value."
